  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The electronic configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8854;</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></msup><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/266689.jpg\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 177px;\" /><br /><br />Bond order of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8861;</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8854;</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> does not exist, due to zero bond order.",
